{"unit_id": "tag:062P:title", "translation": "锥（Cones）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Cones", "target_term": "锥"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Cones", "target_term": "锥", "context": "本节标题所指的代数几何对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:062P:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在代数几何（algebraic geometry）中，锥（cones）与分次（graded）代数（algebras）相对应。按我们的约定，分次环（graded ring）或分次代数（algebra）<MATH_0001>带有按非负整数（nonnegative integers）给出的分次（grading）<MATH_0002>，见代数（Algebra）一章的<REF_0001>节。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何"}, {"source_term": "cones", "target_term": "锥"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "nonnegative integers", "target_term": "非负整数"}, {"source_term": "grading", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何", "context": "指句首限定的数学领域。"}, {"source_term": "cones", "target_term": "锥", "context": "指与分次代数相对应的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰与锥相对应的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指与锥相对应的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "指按所述约定带有分次的环。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指与分次环并列的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "nonnegative integers", "target_term": "非负整数", "context": "指给出分次的指标。"}, {"source_term": "grading", "target_term": "分次", "context": "指分次环或分次代数所带的结构。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "此处用作所引章节所在的章名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:062Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra）。假设<MATH_0004>是同构（isomorphism）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>通常会假设<MATH_0005>由<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上生成（generated）。为了与<REF_0001>保持一致，我们不作这一假设。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>与<MATH_0008>关联的锥（cone associated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或称<TEXTITOPEN_0002>与<MATH_0009>关联的仿射锥（affine cone associated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，为\n<MATH_0010>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "cone associated", "target_term": "关联的锥"}, {"source_term": "affine cone associated", "target_term": "关联的仿射锥"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指定义起始处给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "指分次代数须具备的性质。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰定义所用的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指用来定义关联锥的带分次对象。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指对给定映射的假设。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "脚注中指通常附加的代数生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "cone associated", "target_term": "关联的锥", "context": "指定义所得的锥，关联对象以受保护的数学记号给出。"}, {"source_term": "affine cone associated", "target_term": "关联的仿射锥", "context": "指定义中同一构造的另一名称。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:062P:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n与<MATH_0001>-代数（algebras）的分次（graded）层（sheaf）关联的锥（cone associated）带有一些额外的结构。具体地说，我们得到一个分次（grading）\n<MATH_0002>\n因此，我们可以如下定义抽象锥（abstract cone）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "cone associated", "target_term": "关联的锥"}, {"source_term": "grading", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "abstract cone", "target_term": "抽象锥"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指所述分次层中的代数类型。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰用于构造锥的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指构造锥所用的代数层。"}, {"source_term": "cone associated", "target_term": "关联的锥", "context": "指与给定分次代数层关联的锥。"}, {"source_term": "grading", "target_term": "分次", "context": "指由关联锥的构造所得到的结构。"}, {"source_term": "abstract cone", "target_term": "抽象锥", "context": "指下文将定义的对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:062R:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>锥（cone）<MATH_0002>（在<MATH_0003>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的仿射（affine）态射（morphism），其中<MATH_0004>带有分次（graded）<MATH_0005>-代数（algebra）结构\n<MATH_0006>\n，且<MATH_0007>。<TEXTITOPEN_0002>锥的态射（morphism of cones）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>（从<MATH_0008>到<MATH_0009>）是一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>，使得诱导映射（induced map）\n<MATH_0011>\n与给定的分次（gradings）相容（compatible）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "cone", "target_term": "锥"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "morphism of cones", "target_term": "锥的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射"}, {"source_term": "gradings", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "compatible", "target_term": "相容"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指锥所在的底对象。"}, {"source_term": "cone", "target_term": "锥", "context": "指本段以仿射态射和分次结构定义的对象。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所述仿射态射的源与靶。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "指锥在底概形上的结构态射须具备的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指锥在底概形上的仿射态射。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰定义所要求的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指在受保护的数学记号所给对象上赋予的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "morphism of cones", "target_term": "锥的态射", "context": "指诱导映射与所给分次相容的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指构成锥的态射所用的态射。"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射", "context": "指由所述态射诱导并须与给定分次相容的映射。"}, {"source_term": "gradings", "target_term": "分次", "context": "指给定的源与靶的分次。"}, {"source_term": "compatible", "target_term": "相容", "context": "描述诱导映射与给定分次的关系。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:062P:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n任意向量丛（vector bundle）都是锥（cone）的一个例子。事实上，<MATH_0001>上的向量丛（vector bundles）范畴（category）是<MATH_0002>上的锥（cones）范畴（category）的满子范畴（full subcategory）。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "vector bundle", "target_term": "向量丛"}, {"source_term": "cone", "target_term": "锥"}, {"source_term": "vector bundles", "target_term": "向量丛"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "cones", "target_term": "锥"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "full subcategory", "target_term": "满子范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "vector bundle", "target_term": "向量丛", "context": "首句将任意此类对象作为锥的例子。"}, {"source_term": "cone", "target_term": "锥", "context": "指首句所举例子的所属类型。"}, {"source_term": "vector bundles", "target_term": "向量丛", "context": "指给定底对象上组成满子范畴的对象。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指给定底对象上的向量丛所组成的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "cones", "target_term": "锥", "context": "指给定底对象上组成较大范畴的对象。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指给定底对象上的锥所组成的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "full subcategory", "target_term": "满子范畴", "context": "描述向量丛范畴在锥范畴中的子范畴关系。"}], "notes": []}
